---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About D&D Land Works | Excavation Contractor | Lane County, OR"
  description="D&D Land Works is a licensed and bonded excavation contractor (CCB #261742) run by David Deggelman, serving Eugene, Springfield, and Lane County, OR. DEQ certified for septic work."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 items-center">

        <!-- Left -->
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mb-6">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-blue"></span>
            Owner-Operated &amp; Local
          </span>
          <h1 class="font-display font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-4xl text-ink md:text-5xl leading-tight">
            About D&D Land Works -<br />
            <span class="text-brand-blue">Lane County's</span> Excavation Contractor
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
            D&D Land Works is a local, owner-operated excavation and site prep contractor run by David Deggelman. We provide excavation, land clearing, grading, drainage, utility trenching, driveway work, and DEQ certified septic installation and repair across Lane County, Oregon.
          </p>

          <!-- Stats -->
          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-8">
            <div>
              <p class="font-display font-black text-3xl text-brand-blue">5 <span class="text-safety-orange">★</span></p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Google Reviews</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-display font-black text-3xl text-ink">CCB<span class="text-brand-blue">#</span>261742</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Licensed &amp; Bonded</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-display font-black text-3xl text-ink">Lane <span class="text-brand-blue">Co.</span></p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Oregon, Primary Service Area</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA buttons -->
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-cta">Get a Free Estimate</a>
            <a href="https://search.ccb.state.or.us/search/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">Verify CCB License</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: image + floating cards -->
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl aspect-4/3 shadow-xl">
            <img
              src="/project-excavation-bucket.webp"
              alt="D&D Land Works excavation contractor, Lane County Oregon"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="eager"
            />
          </div>
          <!-- Floating card 1 -->
          <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-lg px-4 py-3">
            <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-blue-light text-brand-blue">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3l8 3v5c0 5.25-3.5 10.15-8 11.5C7.5 21.15 4 16.25 4 11V6l8-3Z" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <div class="leading-tight">
              <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-ink">CCB #261742</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Licensed &amp; Bonded</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Floating card 2 -->
          <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-blue shadow-lg px-4 py-3 text-white">
            <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/15">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 7c0-1.7 2.7-3 6-3s6 1.3 6 3v10c0 1.7-2.7 3-6 3s-6-1.3-6-3V7Z M6 7c0 1.7 2.7 3 6 3s6-1.3 6-3" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            <div class="leading-tight">
              <p class="font-display font-bold text-sm">DEQ Certified</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-white/70">Septic Install &amp; Repair</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It All Started -->
  <section class="bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-display font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-3xl text-ink md:text-4xl mb-8">How It All Started</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-left">
        <p>
          D&D Land Works is owned and operated by <strong class="text-ink">David Deggelman</strong>, based in Springfield, Oregon. David built the business around one straightforward idea: show up, walk the property, and give a real estimate based on what's actually there, not a number pulled from a rate sheet.
        </p>
        <p>
          The work covers the full range of site prep and excavation, clearing land before a build, cutting a driveway, grading for drainage, trenching for utilities, and digging for septic systems. David is DEQ certified for septic installation and repair, which means one contractor handles both the excavation and the septic work, without bringing in a second crew.
        </p>
        <p>
          Springfield sits close enough to Eugene that both cities get the same scheduling, not one treated as an add-on to the other. Lane County is the core service area, from Junction City and Coburg in the north to Cottage Grove and Creswell in the south, and out to the coast near Florence when the project calls for it.
        </p>
        <p>
          The business is licensed and bonded under <strong class="text-ink">CCB #261742</strong>. Free estimates come standard. David walks every property in person before a number goes on paper.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Sets Us Apart -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-display font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-3xl text-ink md:text-4xl">What Sets Us Apart</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-500">The principles that guide every job</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {[
          { num: '01', title: 'Free Estimates, In Person', body: "David walks the property before quoting. Pricing reflects what's actually on the site, slope, access, ground conditions, and scope, not a flat rate." },
          { num: '02', title: 'Licensed, Bonded & DEQ Certified', body: 'CCB #261742 covers excavation and site prep. DEQ certification covers septic installation and repair. One contractor handles both without a second crew.' },
          { num: '03', title: 'Local Knowledge', body: 'Lane County properties vary, flat farmland, steep hillsides, rural access roads, tight urban lots. David has worked them all and knows what each type of site actually needs.' },
          { num: '04', title: 'Straight Communication', body: 'The estimate describes the scope plainly. If conditions change during the job, the conversation happens before costs change, not after.' },
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="flex gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-7">
            <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-blue font-display font-black text-white text-sm">
              {item.num}
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-ink text-base">{item.title}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">{item.body}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The D&D Promise -->
  <section class="bg-ink py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-display font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl">The D&D Land Works Promise</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">What you can expect from every project</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {[
          { icon: '<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z" />', title: 'Honest Estimates', body: 'Pricing based on the actual site, no surprises after the quote.' },
          { icon: '<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z" />', title: 'On-Time Work', body: 'We show up when we say we will and finish the job before moving to the next.' },
          { icon: '<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.625 12a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0Zm0 0H8.25m4.125 0a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0Zm0 0H12m4.125 0a.375.375 0 1 1-.75 0 .375.375 0 0 1 .75 0Zm0 0h-.375M21 12c0 4.556-4.03 8.25-9 8.25a9.764 9.764 0 0 1-2.555-.337A5.972 5.972 0 0 1 5.41 20.97a5.969 5.969 0 0 1-.474-.065 4.48 4.48 0 0 0 .978-2.025c.09-.457-.133-.901-.467-1.226C3.93 16.178 3 14.189 3 12c0-4.556 4.03-8.25 9-8.25s9 3.694 9 8.25Z" />', title: 'Clear Communication', body: 'If something changes on the job, you hear about it before the cost changes.' },
          { icon: '<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 8.25c0-2.485-2.099-4.5-4.688-4.5-1.935 0-3.597 1.126-4.312 2.733-.715-1.607-2.377-2.733-4.313-2.733C5.1 3.75 3 5.765 3 8.25c0 7.22 9 12 9 12s9-4.78 9-12Z" />', title: 'Site Left Clean', body: 'Work area is cleared and left in order when the job is done.' },
        ].map((item) => (
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-7">
            <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 text-brand-blue-light">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" set:html={item.icon} />
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">{item.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">{item.body}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Bottom CTA -->
  <section class="bg-white border-t border-slate-100 py-16 text-center px-4">
    <h2 class="font-display font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-3xl text-ink">Ready to Talk About Your Project?</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 max-w-lg mx-auto">Call or send a message, David will ask a few questions about the site and set up a time to walk it. Free estimates, no obligation.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="tel:5414018726" class="btn btn-cta">Call 541-401-8726</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Get a Free Estimate</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
